{"rules":[{"id":"otp_ask","category":"otp","weight":0.85,"neg":true,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Asks for your OTP, PIN or password","why":"Banks and apps never ask you to share an OTP, PIN, CVV or password with anyone.","tip":"Never tell anyone your OTP or PIN, not even someone who says they are from the bank.","patterns":["\\b(?:share|send|tell|give|provide|forward|enter|submit|reply\\W+with|read\\W+out|confirm)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:otp|pin|cvv|password|passcode|mpin|upi\\W*pin|atm\\W*pin)\\b","\\b(?:otp|pin|cvv|password|passcode|mpin)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:to\\W+(?:us|me|the\\W+(?:executive|agent|officer))|on\\W+(?:call|whatsapp))\\b","\\botp\\W+(?:batao|bhejo|share\\W+karo|dijiye|bataye|bataiye|bata\\W+do)\\b"]},{"id":"upi_collect","category":"upi","weight":0.85,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Tries to make you approve a payment","why":"You never have to enter a PIN or approve a request to RECEIVE money. That step only sends money out.","tip":"Receiving money never needs your PIN. If asked, it's a scam.","patterns":["\\b(?:enter|put|type|use)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:upi\\W*)?pin\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:to\\W+)?(?:receive|get|credit|claim)\\b","\\b(?:collect|payment|pending)\\W+request\\b.{0,60}\\b(?:approve|accept|pin|pay)\\b","\\bscan\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:qr|code)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:to\\W+)?(?:receive|get|claim|refund|credit)\\b","\\b(?:approve|accept)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:request|collect)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:receive|refund|cashback|get)\\b"]},{"id":"fake_kyc","category":"kyc","weight":0.7,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Fake KYC / account-update pressure","why":"Banks do not ask you to update KYC through an SMS link or a phone number in a message.","tip":"Update KYC only inside the official app or at your branch.","patterns":["\\be?-?kyc\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,10}?(?:expire[ds]?|pending|incomplete|suspend\\w*|block\\w*|update\\W+(?:now|today|immediately|within)|verify\\W+now|deactivat\\w+|not\\W+(?:updated|completed))","\\b(?:update|complete|verify|renew)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:your\\W+)?e?-?kyc\\b","\\b(?:pan|aadhaar|aadhar)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,6}?(?:update|verif\\w+|link\\w*)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:expire|block|suspend|today|now|within|immediately|urgent)"]},{"id":"account_threat","category":"threat","weight":0.55,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":true,"title":"Threatens to block or close something","why":"Scammers invent a threat (blocked, suspended, disconnected) so you panic and act before you think.","tip":"Real services warn you inside their own app. Call the number on your card, not the one in the message.","patterns":["\\b(?:account|card|sim|number|upi|wallet|service|connection|aadhaar|pan)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:will\\W+be|has\\W+been|is\\W+being|shall\\W+be|gets?|is\\W+going\\W+to\\W+be)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,2}?(?:blocked|suspended|deactivated|disconnected|closed|frozen|terminated|cancelled|canceled|deleted)\\b","\\b(?:band|block|suspend)\\W+ho\\W+(?:jayega|jaega|jayegi|jaye)\\b","\\b(?:will|shall)\\W+(?:be\\W+)?(?:blocked|suspended|deactivated|disconnected)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,6}?(?:today|tonight|tomorrow|hours?)\\b"]},{"id":"urgency","category":"urgency","weight":0.35,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Rushes you to act","why":"Pressure and deadlines are used to stop you from checking. Genuine messages rarely give you minutes to decide.","tip":"Slow down. A real problem can wait while you verify it.","patterns":["\\b(?:within|in)\\W+(?:the\\W+)?(?:next\\W+)?\\d+\\W*(?:hours?|hrs?|minutes?|mins?)\\b","\\b(?:immediately|urgent(?:ly)?|right\\W+now|asap|today\\W+only|last\\W+chance|final\\W+(?:notice|warning|reminder)|act\\W+now|expires?\\W+(?:today|tonight)|before\\W+midnight|hurry|limited\\W+time)\\b","\\b(?:turant|fauran|jaldi|aaj\\W+hi|abhi\\W+(?:click|call|pay|update|verify))\\b"]},{"id":"prize","category":"prize","weight":0.7,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Says you won something you never entered","why":"You can't win a lottery or draw you never joined. Prize messages exist to collect a fee or your details.","tip":"If you didn't enter, you didn't win.","patterns":["\\byou(?:\\W+(?:have|just|are|ve))?\\W+(?:won|win|been\\W+selected|are\\W+(?:the\\W+)?(?:lucky\\W+)?winner)\\b","\\bcongratulations?\\b.{0,50}\\b(?:won|prize|reward|gift|winner|selected|lucky)\\b","\\b(?:lucky\\W+draw|lottery|kbc|jackpot)\\b","\\bclaim\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:prize|reward|gift|cashback|bonus)\\b","\\b(?:reward|redeem)\\W+points?\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:expire|expiring|lapse)\\w*","\\b(?:inaam|inam|lottery)\\W+(?:jeeta|jeete|nikli|mila)\\b"]},{"id":"advance_fee","category":"fee","weight":0.55,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Asks for a small fee before you receive anything","why":"Asking you to pay first (registration, processing, customs, redelivery) is the oldest advance-fee trick.","tip":"Real prizes, jobs and loans never ask you to pay money upfront.","patterns":["\\b(?:processing|registration|clearance|redelivery|customs|gst|insurance|refundable|security|activation)\\W+(?:fee|charges?|deposit)\\b"]},{"id":"job_scam","category":"job","weight":0.65,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Too-good-to-be-true job offer","why":"Easy work-from-home pay for likes, ratings or simple tasks is a well-known fraud pattern.","tip":"Genuine employers don't recruit over WhatsApp/Telegram or ask you to pay or do paid 'tasks'.","patterns":["\\b(?:work\\W+from\\W+home|part\\W*time\\W+(?:job|work)|data\\W+entry\\W+job|task\\W*based)\\b.{0,100}\\b(?:earn|income|salary|paid|payment|per\\W+(?:day|hour)|daily|weekly)\\b","\\b(?:like|follow|subscribe|rate|review|watch)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:earn|paid|payment|get\\W+paid|commission)\\b","\\bdaily\\W+(?:income|payout|salary|payment)\\b","\\bghar\\W+baithe\\W+(?:kamao|kamai|paise)\\b","\\bhiring\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:no\\W+experience|freshers?)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,10}?(?:whatsapp|telegram)\\b"]},{"id":"courier","category":"courier","weight":0.5,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Fake parcel / delivery problem","why":"Fake courier texts claim a parcel is stuck to get you to tap a link or pay a small fee.","tip":"Check delivery only from the shop's own app or the courier's official site.","patterns":["\\b(?:parcel|package|shipment|courier|consignment|delivery|order)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:held|on\\W+hold|stuck|failed|could\\W+not\\W+be\\W+delivered|undelivered|returned|detained|seized|address\\W+(?:is\\W+)?(?:incomplete|incorrect|invalid)|reschedule|rescheduled)\\b","\\b(?:update|confirm|correct)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:your\\W+)?(?:delivery\\W+)?address\\b.{0,60}\\b(?:parcel|package|delivery|courier)\\b","\\bcustoms\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,10}?(?:clearance|duty|fee|charge|parcel|package)\\b"]},{"id":"utility_threat","category":"utility","weight":0.7,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Fake electricity/bill disconnection","why":"'Your power will be cut tonight, call this officer' is a common scam. Utilities don't disconnect by SMS at night.","tip":"Check your bill in the official app or on the utility's website.","patterns":["\\b(?:electricity|power|bill|meter|gas|connection)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,10}?(?:disconnect\\w*|cut|discontinu\\w+|terminat\\w+)\\b.{0,100}\\b(?:tonight|today|\\d{1,2}[:.]\\d{2}|call|contact|officer|executive)\\b"]},{"id":"invest","category":"invest","weight":0.65,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Guaranteed returns / investment tips","why":"No genuine investment guarantees profit. 'Double your money' and VIP tip groups are used to steal deposits.","tip":"If it promises a guaranteed profit, it's a scam. Check any advisor on the SEBI website.","patterns":["\\b(?:guaranteed|assured|fixed)\\W+(?:returns?|profits?|income)\\b","\\bdouble\\W+(?:your\\W+)?(?:money|investment)\\b","\\b\\d{2,4}\\W*%\\W*(?:returns?|profits?|guaranteed)\\b","\\b(?:vip|premium|insider)\\W+(?:group|signals?|tips?|channel)\\b","\\b(?:crypto|bitcoin|usdt|forex)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:profit|returns?|earn|invest|doubl\\w+)\\b","\\b(?:stock|share\\W+market|trading)\\W+(?:tips?|signals?|calls?|expert)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:group|channel|join|whatsapp|telegram)\\b"]},{"id":"loan","category":"loan","weight":0.6,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Instant loan with no checks","why":"Genuine lenders check documents and credit history. 'No documents, instant approval' loans are bait.","tip":"Borrow only from RBI-registered lenders, and never pay a fee to 'release' a loan.","patterns":["\\b(?:instant|pre\\W*approved|quick)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?loan\\b","\\bloan\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:no\\W+(?:documents?|cibil|credit\\W+check|collateral)|without\\W+(?:documents?|cibil|income\\W+proof)|approved\\W+in\\W+\\d+\\W*(?:minutes?|mins?))\\b"]},{"id":"authority","category":"authority","weight":0.75,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Pretends to be police or a government agency","why":"Calls or messages claiming a 'drug parcel', 'digital arrest' or legal case are scams. Agencies don't arrest or fine over chat.","tip":"Hang up. No agency settles a case by video call or payment on the spot. Call 1930.","patterns":["\\b(?:cbi|ncb|narcotics|customs|police|cyber\\W*cell|enforcement\\W+directorate|trai|income\\W+tax\\W+(?:dept|department|officer)|rbi)\\b.{0,100}\\b(?:parcel|drugs?|illegal|case|complaint|fir|money\\W+laundering|suspend\\w*|arrest\\w*|summons|warrant|notice)\\b","\\bdigital\\W+arrest\\b","\\byour\\W+(?:aadhaar|aadhar|number)\\W+(?:is|has\\W+been)\\W+(?:linked|used|involved)\\b"]},{"id":"tax_refund","category":"refund","weight":0.6,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Refund bait","why":"Scammers promise tax or payment refunds to get your bank details or PIN.","tip":"Refunds are credited automatically. You never need to enter card details to receive one.","patterns":["\\b(?:income\\W+tax|it\\W+dept|itr)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,10}?refund\\b.{0,100}\\b(?:click|link|submit|claim|share|details|enter|call|verify|whatsapp)\\b","\\b(?:refund|cashback|reversal|compensation)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,10}?(?:pending|initiated|approved)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,12}?(?:click|link|share|scan|enter|call|pin|otp)\\b"]},{"id":"sim_upgrade","category":"sim","weight":0.5,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Fake SIM block / upgrade","why":"'Your SIM will be blocked' or 'upgrade to 5G' texts lead to link or OTP traps.","tip":"Telecom operators don't block SIMs through random links. Check with your operator's app.","patterns":["\\b(?:sim|mobile\\W+number)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,6}?(?:block\\w*|deactivat\\w+|expire[sd]?|disconnect\\w*|suspend\\w*|upgrade)\\b","\\bupgrade\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:to\\W+)?(?:4g|5g)\\W+(?:sim)?\\b"]},{"id":"remote_access","category":"remote","weight":0.8,"neg":true,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Asks you to install a remote-control app","why":"Apps like AnyDesk or TeamViewer let a stranger see and control your phone, including banking apps.","tip":"Never install screen-sharing apps at a stranger's request.","patterns":["\\b(?:anydesk|teamviewer|quick\\W*support|rustdesk|ultraviewer|airdroid|screen\\W*shar\\w+)\\b"]},{"id":"apk","category":"apk","weight":0.75,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Pushes you to install an app from a link","why":"Apps installed from links (APK files) can read your messages and OTPs.","tip":"Install apps only from the Play Store or App Store.","patterns":["\\.apk\\b","\\b(?:download|install)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:the\\W+)?(?:apk|app)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:link|below|here)\\b"]},{"id":"off_platform","category":"offplatform","weight":0.3,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Moves you to WhatsApp or Telegram","why":"Scammers move chats to private apps where there is no oversight.","tip":"Be careful when an 'official' contact asks you to continue on WhatsApp or Telegram.","patterns":["\\b(?:message|contact|text|dm|join|add)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:on\\W+)?(?:whatsapp|telegram|signal)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:group|channel|link|number|\\+?\\d{10})\\b","\\b(?:wa\\.me|t\\.me)/"]},{"id":"credential","category":"credential","weight":0.6,"neg":true,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Asks for card or login details","why":"No genuine company asks for your full card, net-banking login or ID numbers by message.","tip":"Enter card details only on the checkout page of a site you opened yourself.","patterns":["\\b(?:verify|confirm|update|enter|share|send)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:card\\W+(?:number|details)|net\\W*banking|login\\W+(?:id|credentials|details)|atm\\W*pin|debit\\W+card|credit\\W+card\\W+details|aadhaar\\W+number|pan\\W+(?:number|details))\\b"]},{"id":"family_impersonation","category":"family","weight":0.65,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Pretends to be a relative in trouble","why":"'Hi Mom, I lost my phone, this is my new number, send money' is a common impersonation scam.","tip":"Call the relative on their old number or ask a question only they can answer before sending money.","patterns":["\\b(?:hi|hello|hey)?\\W*(?:mom|mum|mama|mummy|dad|papa|beta|bhaiya|didi|uncle|aunty)\\b.{0,120}\\b(?:new\\W+number|lost\\W+my\\W+phone|phone\\W+(?:is\\W+)?(?:broken|damaged|lost|dead)|use\\W+this\\W+number)\\b","\\b(?:new\\W+number|lost\\W+my\\W+phone|phone\\W+(?:is\\W+)?(?:broken|damaged|lost))\\b.{0,160}\\b(?:send|transfer|pay|gpay|upi)\\b.{0,60}\\b(?:urgent\\w*|right\\W+now|immediately|today)\\b"]},{"id":"gift_card","category":"giftcard","weight":0.6,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Asks for gift cards or codes","why":"Nobody legitimate asks you to pay with gift cards or voucher codes.","tip":"Gift cards are not a payment method for bills, taxes or jobs.","patterns":["\\b(?:gift\\W+card|google\\W+play\\W+(?:code|card)|itunes\\W+card|amazon\\W+pay\\W+(?:card|voucher))\\b"]},{"id":"secrecy","category":"secrecy","weight":0.6,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Tells you to keep it secret","why":"Scammers isolate you so family or the bank can't warn you.","tip":"Any request to 'tell no one' is a red flag. Talk to someone you trust.","patterns":["\\b(?:do\\W+not|don'?t|never)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,3}?(?:tell|inform|discuss|share\\W+with)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:anyone|family|your\\W+(?:bank|family)|police)\\b.{0,0}","\\bkeep\\W+(?:this|it)\\W+(?:confidential|secret|private)\\b"]},{"id":"guarantee","category":"prize","weight":0.4,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Over-the-top promises","why":"'100% guaranteed' and 'risk-free' are things honest offers avoid.","tip":"If it sounds too good to be true, it is.","patterns":["\\b100\\W*%\\W*(?:guaranteed|safe|genuine|legit|secure|profit)\\b","\\brisk\\W*free\\b","\\bno\\W+risk\\b"]},{"id":"contact_number","category":"link","weight":0.35,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Pushes you to call a number in the message","why":"Scam texts often give a mobile number to call. A real bank's number is on the back of your card.","tip":"Look up the official number yourself; don't trust the one in the message.","patterns":["\\b(?:call|contact|whatsapp|ring|dial)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,5}?(?:on|at|:)?\\W*(?:\\+?91[\\s-]?)?[6-9]\\d{9}\\b"]},{"id":"click_link","category":"link","weight":0.3,"neg":false,"ctx_skip":false,"title":"Tells you to tap a link","why":"Links in unexpected messages are the main way phishing works.","tip":"Don't tap links in unexpected messages. Open the app or type the website yourself.","patterns":["\\b(?:click|tap|open|visit|follow|login|log\\W+in|sign\\W+in)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:the\\W+)?(?:link|below|here|url)\\b","\\b(?:link\\W+(?:par|pe)\\W+)?(?:click|tap)\\W+(?:karein|kare|karo|kijiye)\\b"]}],"safe_rules":[{"id":"otp_notice","weight":0.2,"title":"Standard OTP notice","why":"This warns you NOT to share the code, which is what genuine banks do.","patterns":["\\b(?:do\\W+not|don'?t|never)\\W+share\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,4}?(?:otp|pin|code|password|cvv)\\b","\\bis\\W+(?:your|the)\\W+(?:otp|one\\W*time\\W+(?:password|pin)|verification\\W+code)\\b"]},{"id":"txn_alert","weight":0.15,"title":"Normal transaction alert format","why":"Plain debit/credit alerts with no link and no request are what banks really send.","patterns":["\\b(?:debited|credited)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,8}?(?:a/?c|account|ac|upi|ref|txn)\\b","\\b(?:avl|available)\\W+bal"]}],"brands":{"SBI":{"keywords":["sbi","onlinesbi","yonosbi","statebank"],"official":["sbi.co.in","onlinesbi.sbi","onlinesbi.com","sbicard.com","yonosbi.com"]},"HDFC Bank":{"keywords":["hdfc","hdfcbank"],"official":["hdfcbank.com","hdfc.com","hdfclife.com"]},"ICICI Bank":{"keywords":["icici","icicibank"],"official":["icicibank.com","icicilombard.com","iciciprulife.com"]},"Axis Bank":{"keywords":["axisbank","axis"],"official":["axisbank.com"]},"Kotak":{"keywords":["kotak"],"official":["kotak.com"]},"PNB":{"keywords":["pnbindia","netpnb","pnb"],"official":["pnbindia.in","netpnb.com"]},"Bank of Baroda":{"keywords":["bankofbaroda","bobibanking"],"official":["bankofbaroda.in","bankofbaroda.com"]},"Canara Bank":{"keywords":["canarabank"],"official":["canarabank.com"]},"IDFC First":{"keywords":["idfcfirstbank","idfcbank"],"official":["idfcfirstbank.com"]},"Yes Bank":{"keywords":["yesbank"],"official":["yesbank.in"]},"Union Bank":{"keywords":["unionbank","unionbankofindia"],"official":["unionbankofindia.co.in"]},"Bank of India":{"keywords":["bankofindia"],"official":["bankofindia.co.in"]},"IndusInd":{"keywords":["indusind","indusindbank"],"official":["indusind.com"]},"Federal Bank":{"keywords":["federalbank"],"official":["federalbank.co.in"]},"RBL Bank":{"keywords":["rblbank"],"official":["rblbank.com"]},"AU Small Finance Bank":{"keywords":["aubank"],"official":["aubank.in"]},"Indian Bank":{"keywords":["indianbank"],"official":["indianbank.in"]},"IDBI Bank":{"keywords":["idbibank"],"official":["idbibank.in"]},"BHIM":{"keywords":["bhim","bhimupi"],"official":["bhimupi.org.in"]},"MobiKwik":{"keywords":["mobikwik"],"official":["mobikwik.com"]},"Freecharge":{"keywords":["freecharge"],"official":["freecharge.in"]},"Paytm":{"keywords":["paytm","paytmbank"],"official":["paytm.com","paytmbank.com"]},"PhonePe":{"keywords":["phonepe"],"official":["phonepe.com"]},"Google":{"keywords":["google","gpay"],"official":["google.com","google.co.in","gpay.app.goo.gl"]},"Amazo